# Pre-PR gate routing

When the user wants to **validate before a PR**, **run pre-PR checks**, or says the branch is **ready for review/opening a PR**:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/pre-pr-gate/SKILL.md`
2. Run `tools/cursor/validate-contribution.sh` from the repo root unless the user scoped a narrower check
3. Do not claim checks passed without running the script (or equivalent commands) and reporting output

First-time contributors may reach this via `.cursor/skills/first-contribution/SKILL.md` § Verify — same skill and script.
